      "rationale": "Proxies WASM library requests through a Cloudflare Worker to bypass CORS restrictions when loading AGPL-licensed components (PyMuPDF, Ghostscript, CoherentPDF) from external CDN sources; enforces origin validation, rate limiting, file-type/size restrictions and caching, and supports self-hosting by letting operators point the proxy at their own WASM origins via secrets."
